{"summary":"Create an abstract factory","description":"*Try Shapez up to level 7 for free or unlock the full game for more tools, more shapes and more challenges! - now 70% off for two weeks!*\n\nDo you like automation games? Then you are in the right place!\n\nshapez is a relaxed game in which you have to build factories for the automated production of geometric shapes. As the level increases, the shapes become more and more complex, and you have to spread out on the infinite map.\nAnd as if that wasn't enough, you also have to produce exponentially more to satisfy the demands - the only thing that helps is scaling! While you only have to process shapes at the beginning, you will later have to color them - by extracting and mixing colors!\n\nFEATURES\n- Create a unique and complex abstract shapes factory in a satisfying way.\n- Unlock new devices, upgrade them, and optimize your factory by experimenting with diverse tools.\n- Develop your system the way you want: each problem can have many solutions.\n- Enjoy an elegant, minimalist and readable art direction.\n- Go at your own pace with an approachable gameplay and a soothing soundtrack.\n\nCAREFULLY REDESIGNED FOR MOBILE\n- Revamped interface\n- Google Play Games achievements\n- Cloud Save - Share your progress between Android devices\n\nIf you run into a problem, please contact us at https://playdigious.helpshift.com/hc/en/12-playdigious/ with as much information as possible on the issue.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.30 - $4.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QJAxyd8jifI?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QggTLc1ZU5d32U3ujErx6ECU8ElbxggK3J4wHIGlR14ZPCGpIbGyblcfquka2CsrNQ9A1JdJJDHbODw1PllmNw","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5RaQt9Dx6l8B77KLzWPbXMDvsvKniwApicCTeVILhdQ2tRqwwlajOladEopKLPfug1fSM7xb_InsW8blCznu3g","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RxLLGQ7ZWainxGl0BlvQ41AI9HUWCyvaBsUH1qH8cW3u9VGtoP9Ttd_M